flowchart LR

    Dev[Developer]
    Gitea[Gitea Repository]
    CI[CI Pipeline]
    Registry[Container Registry<br/>GHCR]
    GitOpsRepo[GitOps Configuration]
    ArgoCD[Argo CD]
    K3s[k3s Cluster]
    App[Running Application]

    Dev -->|Push code| Gitea
    Gitea -->|Trigger build| CI
    CI -->|Build and push image| Registry
    CI -->|Update image tag / manifests| GitOpsRepo
    GitOpsRepo -->|Desired state| ArgoCD
    ArgoCD -->|Sync| K3s
    K3s --> App
